-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">및 타교 학생 중 당해 학교장의 추천을&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">수강과목수</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">:</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 2과목 6학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 수업기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2011. 12. 23(금) ~ 2012. 1. 16(월), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1월 11일(수) 수업함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 수업일자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 월, 화, 목, 금 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">주4일 수업</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, 총15일 수업)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 대상과목</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 일반과목 및 MSC과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">개설과목 및 수업시간표</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">2011. 11. 23(수) 이후 홈페이지 공지 및 원스톱서비스&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n